A||N||11||contra||Installing a turbocharger...||||5||
Z||000000||contra||07-13-2000||03:16 PM||||In the not so distant future i would like to install a turbo charger on my fiero 2.8<BR>I was just wondering what turbo chargers i can use off of other cars and what improvements i can expect. There is quite a few wreckers around my area that can sell me a turbo charger used for fairly cheap. I just need to know what else i'll need other than the turbo itself, and maybe some instructions from anybody who's installed one before.<BR>thanx<BR>||||reg||5
Z||000001||TOM||07-13-2000||08:20 PM||||I used a T3 garret from a mid 80's thunderbird or cougar. They are water cooled. You will also need a way to retard the timing under boost like with a MSD 6BTM and you will need a way to increase the fuel delevery. Like a rising rate controller or a new chip for the ECM||||reg||1
Z||000002||contra||07-13-2000||08:46 PM||||cool, what about piping and all that?<BR>do i need any gasgets and special equipment from the donor vehical?||||reg||1
Z||000003||TOM||07-14-2000||12:45 AM||||You will need to buy a flange from turbo city or someplace like that. The pipes will have to be custom made. Bascally you take the Y pipe and make it connect at the flange then you need a   straight ish pipe as a down pipe to the exhaust. On those turbos the waste gate is in the turbine exhaust housing. You will need this. Also you will need the compressor inlet pipe. Sounds complicated but if you look at one I think you will see what you need. Also the kit to rebuild these is around $50 so you dont need a perfect one. But be sure to look in side and make sure the wheels HAVE NOT contacted the side of the housing. It will show up as a scrape. If it has its not too bad but you will need to send it out to be balanced. I have pics of the install if you need.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Fret Naught||07-14-2000||01:29 AM||||Contra,<BR>Try this WEB Site, you will find it full of useful information <A HREF="http://members.xoom.com/_XMCM/dlagrua/designing.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://members.xoom.com/_XMCM/dlagrua/designing.htm</A> <BR>I had to type it in cause I don't know how to post a link. Sorry||||reg||12
Z||000005||Fret Naught||07-14-2000||01:30 AM||||Well how do you like that!!! it works||||reg||1
